# Never let a locally-built, platform-specific artifact (or dependencies
# installed on the host) leak into a Docker build context. Everything the
# image needs is installed/generated fresh inside the container itself
# (see artifacts/api-server/Dockerfile's `pnpm install` and
# `pnpm --filter "@workspace/db" run prisma:generate` steps).
**/node_modules

# Prisma Client output is platform-specific (query engine binaries) and is
# regenerated inside the container for its actual target platform; a
# locally-generated copy (e.g. Windows engine binaries from host dev) must
# never be copied in as-is. Scoped to lib/db specifically -- a blanket
# **/generated previously also excluded the committed, cross-platform
# lib/api-client-react/src/generated/ API client the web build needs,
# breaking every fresh `docker compose build web` with a Rollup
# "Could not resolve ./generated/api" error.
lib/db/generated

# Real tenant data -- never belongs in a build context.
backups/
